cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GSE338571 RNA-seq Interaction Analysis"
version: 1.0.0
type: software

abstract: >
  Reproducible computational workflow for the GSE338571 RNA-seq interaction
  analysis of cell-context-dependent epithelial transcriptional responses
  associated with macrophage IL-1β exposure. The workflow includes CPM
  normalization, expression filtering, log2(CPM + 0.5) transformation,
  two-factor ordinary least-squares interaction testing, Benjamini-Hochberg
  false discovery rate correction, and primary-result validation.

keywords:
  - RNA-seq
  - transcriptomics
  - GSE338571
  - IL-1β
  - epithelial cells
  - macrophages
  - interaction analysis
  - computational biology
  - reproducible research

license: MIT

